\v 7 Or did¦124424 I disobey \nd God¦124434\nd* when I humbled¦124426 myself¦124425 so that¦124427 all of you might be¦124429 elevated, because¦124430 I shared the good message with you¦124428 all¦124428 without any personal gain?
