\p
\v 1 It's¦124842 not¦124844 appropriate¦124842 or beneficial¦124846 to be¦124849 boasting¦124840, so I'll¦124849 come¦124849 to \add the\add* visions¦124854 and¦124855 revelations¦124856 from \nd Yahweh¦124857\nd*.\f + \fr 12:1 \ft See http://bibledifferences.net/2019/04/24/156-boast.\f*
\v 2 Fourteen¦124864 years¦124863 ago I observed a man¦124859 who was a believer in \nd Messiah¦124861\nd* who was pulled \add up\add* to the third¦124884 heaven¦124885. (I didn't¦124868 know whether¦124865 this physically happened or¦124870 just in the spiritual \add realm\add*.)
