\v 14 Now listen¦125115, I'm ready¦125118 to visit you¦125122 all¦125122 for the third¦125116 time¦125116 and¦125123 I won't¦125124 be aiming to burden¦125125 you down because¦125128 I'm not¦125127 after what¦125130 you have¦125119, but rather \add my interest is in\add* you yourselves. The¦125137 children shouldn't¦125124 be saving \add to support\add* the parents, but the parents \add should support\add* the children.
\v 15 I'm happy to invest everything I have, including¦125152 all of myself, for¦125154 the sake of your¦125157 souls¦125156. Am¦125165 I being¦125165 loved¦125165 less the more that I love you¦125157 all¦125157?
