\v 16 So that's that. I'm didn't¦125169 burden¦125172 you all, but¦125167 being¦125176 crafty¦125177 \add by nature\add*, I took¦125180 you all by trickery.
\v 17 Did any of¦125183 those that I sent¦125184 to¦125185 you exploit¦125189 you¦125186 all¦125186?
