\v 19 \add Now\add* you're already supposing¦125213 that we're defending¦125216 \add ourselves\add*? \add Actually,\add* we're speaking¦125223 \add as followers of\add* \nd Messiah¦125222\nd* knowing that \nd God¦125220\nd* is watching, and¦125225 dear friends, everything has been \add with the aim of\add* building¦125231 you up.
