\v 21 \add I'm worried that\add* when I come¦125264, \nd God¦125271\nd* will¦125268 humble¦125268 me there with you¦125274 all¦125274, and I might be upset about many¦125277 who've sinned¦125279 in the past and haven't repented¦125282 from the impurity¦125285 and sexual¦125287 immorality¦125287 and self-centred living that they¦125291 practiced¦125291.
