\v 1 This¦125294 is the¦125303 third time¦125293 that¦125294 I'll be coming¦125297 there to¦125299 you¦125300 all¦125300. ‘Every¦125310 account must¦125309 be confirmed by at least two¦125304, \add preferably\add* three¦125308, witnesses¦125305.’\x + \xo 13:1: \xt Deu 17:6; 19:15.\x*
