\v 5 Test yourselves to check if you're \add living\add* in the¦125391 faith¦125392—you yourselves can decide that. Or can't¦125396 you¦125389 all¦125389 recognise¦125397 whether¦125388 or not \nd Messiah¦125400 Yeshua\nd* is living in you? Surely¦125407 you're not that unqualified¦125408?
